# Portfolio source of truth

This project is a personal portfolio. Page copy, facts, and the portrait come from files, not from guesses.

- Read `content/resume.md` before writing any bio, job, project, skill, date, or link.
- If a fact is missing, leave it blank or ask. Never invent employers, titles, dates, metrics, or URLs.
- The portrait is `public/images/portrait.jpg`, referenced by the `photo` field in the resume frontmatter.
- When the resume markdown changes, update the site to match it. Do not keep a second copy of the same facts in components.
- Keep section headings in `content/resume.md` stable: About, Skills, Experience, Projects, Education, Contact.

